  m_text: 'Wizzledizzles are a passive semi-robotic

    creature that wander around
    majority of the

    planets in this system. They are known for

    their peculiar
    eyes and irregular diet that

    mainly consists of carbon. Recent studies

    show
    that despite their lack of understanding

    of everything around them, their
    IQ is above

    genius levels.'
